### ==================== 認證 ====================

### 註冊
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 登入
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### ==================== 單字本 ====================

### 取得所有單字本
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 新增單字本（日文）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "JLPT N1 必考單字",
  "language": "JAPANESE"
}

### 新增單字本（英文）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "多益必考單字",
  "language": "ENGLISH"
}

### 刪除單字本
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/books/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==================== 單字 ====================

### 取得單字本的所有單字
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books/1/words
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 新增單字（日文）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/books/1/words
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "word": "勉強",
  "reading": "べんきょう",
  "translation": "學習、讀書",
  "example": "毎日日本語を勉強しています。",
  "level": "JLPT_N5",
  "language": "JAPANESE"
}

### 新增單字（英文）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/books/2/words
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "word": "accomplish",
  "reading": "",
  "translation": "完成、達成",
  "example": "She accomplished her goal.",
  "level": "TOEIC_700_900",
  "language": "ENGLISH"
}

### 修改單字
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/words/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "word": "勉強",
  "reading": "べんきょう",
  "translation": "學習、讀書（更新）",
  "example": "毎日日本語を勉強しています。",
  "level": "JLPT_N5",
  "language": "JAPANESE"
}

### 刪除單字
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/words/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==================== 測驗 ====================

### 取得測驗單字（隨機 10 題）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/study/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 送出答題結果
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/study/result
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "wordId": 1,
  "correct": true
}

### ==================== 統計 ====================

### 取得學習統計
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
